#: src/onboarding.py:572
msgid "Couldn't record the second model"
msgstr "Alterum exemplar recordari non potuit"

#: src/onboarding.py:572
msgid ""
"Your first model is saved, so face login already works. Make sure your"
" face is well lit and centred, then try again -- or skip and add a mod"
"el later from Settings."
msgstr ""
"Primum exemplar tuum servatum est, itaque accessus vultu iam operatur."
" Cura ut vultus tuus bene illuminatus et in medio sit, deinde iterum c"
"onare — vel omitte et exemplar postea ex Optionibus adde."

#: src/onboarding.py:607
msgid "Add a face model (required)"
msgstr "Exemplar vultus addere (necessarium)"

#: src/onboarding.py:609
msgid ""
"Face login needs at least one face model, so this scan can't be skippe"
"d. Record it in the light you usually sit in. Lighting changes how you"
"r face looks to the camera, so consider adding a second model later fr"
"om Settings, recorded in different light (for example evening lamps in"
"stead of daylight)."
msgstr ""
"Accessus vultu saltem unum exemplar vultus requirit, itaque haec scans"
"io omitti non potest. In luce in qua plerumque sedes id recorda. Lux m"
"utat quomodo camera vultum tuum videt; itaque considera postea ex Opti"
"onibus alterum exemplar addere in alia luce recordatum (exempli gratia"
" vesperi sub lucernis pro luce diurna)."

#: src/onboarding.py:618
msgid "Add a second face model (recommended)"
msgstr "Alterum exemplar vultus addere (commendatur)"

#: src/onboarding.py:620
msgid ""
"Your first model is saved. Lighting changes how your face looks to the"
" camera: a model recorded in daylight can fail in the evening under la"
"mps (or the other way round), and Ubuntu Hello then times out instead "
"of unlocking. A second model recorded in different light keeps recogni"
"tion reliable at any time of day."
msgstr ""
"Primum exemplar tuum servatum est. Lux mutat quomodo camera vultum tuu"
"m videt: exemplar in luce diurna recordatum vesperi sub lucernis defic"
"ere potest (vel contra), et tunc Ubuntu Hello tempus excedit pro reser"
"ando. Alterum exemplar in alia luce recordatum agnitionem quovis tempo"
"re diei fidam servat."

#: src/onboarding.py:622
msgid ""
"Change the lighting first: switch the room light or desk lamp on or of"
"f, turn away from the window, or put on the glasses you sometimes wear"
". Then look straight into the camera and press Scan."
msgstr ""
"Primum lucem muta: lumen cubiculi vel lucernam mensae accende aut exst"
"ingue, a fenestra te averte, aut perspicilla quae interdum geris indue"
". Deinde recta in cameram intuere et Scandere preme."

