#: src/main.glade:454 src/onboarding.glade:110
msgid "Keyring / KWallet Auto-Unlock"
msgstr "Keyring / KW⟧ Auto- Basem"

#: src/main.glade:471
msgid ""
"Enable face authentication to automatically unlock your login keyring "
"or KWallet on login. This securely stores your password sealed in the "
"TPM when available, or encrypted with AES-256-GCM using a root-only ma"
"ster key. Face auth sets PAM_AUTHTOK for pam_gnome_keyring or pam_kwal"
"let5 depending on your desktop."
msgstr ""
"Admitte faciem authenticas ut sponte aperias aperiens conventum tuum k"
"eyring vel KW⟧ in login. Hoc secure tesseram tuam obsignatam in TPM cu"
"m promptu reponit, aut cum AES impressis utens clavem domini soli radi"
"x. Facies auth ponit PAM⟧ pro PGK⟧ vel PKW⟧ pendens in escritorio tuo."

